@startuml
title Sign in with Google
actor User
participant MainFrame
participant AuthService
participant GoogleAuthService as GAS
participant Browser
participant Google
participant UserDAO
participant SessionManager
User -> MainFrame : Sign in
MainFrame -> AuthService : signInWithGoogle() [worker thread]
AuthService -> GAS : signIn()
GAS -> Browser : open consent URL (PKCE)
Browser -> Google : user approves
Google -> GAS : code on http://127.0.0.1:port
GAS -> Google : exchange code for tokens
GAS -> Google : userinfo (sub, email, name, picture)
GAS --> AuthService : Profile (refresh token saved in ~/.textcraft)
AuthService -> UserDAO : find by google_id or create
AuthService -> SessionManager : setUser(user)
SessionManager -> MainFrame : onSessionChanged (EDT)
MainFrame -> MainFrame : show avatar, load settings (theme, Lite)
@enduml
